# Summary: Profile interactive zsh startup

## Usage

    dev zsh-profile bench            # warm + cold timings and a zprof table
    dev zsh-profile analyze <log>    # rank an xtrace log by time per file:line

Profiling is opt-in via the `ZSH_PROFILE` env var (set up in
`dotfiles/zsh/.zshenv`). It runs for interactive shells only:

    ZSH_PROFILE=zprof  zsh -ic exit    # function/hook table
    ZSH_PROFILE=xtrace zsh -ic exit    # line log to /tmp/zsh-startup.$$.log

Override the xtrace log path with `ZSH_PROFILE_LOG`, then rank it:

    dev zsh-profile analyze /tmp/zsh-startup.$$.log
